166 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 119 0 R
/E (India's 63 million small businesses run on paper ledgers and manual GST filings, completely outside the formal financial system. Paytm processes hundreds of millions of transactions daily yet none of that data flows back to help the merchants generating it. The same UPI transaction that could build a shopkeeper's credit profile, reconcile their taxes, and predict their cash flow does none of those things today. The infrastructure exists; the intelligence layer is missing.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [29]
>>
endobj
